# Default owners for everything. Without this line a path with no entry has no code owner, so
# the required code-owner review does not apply to it: build files, the composite actions
# under .github/actions/ and Dependabot's configuration among them. The last matching
# pattern wins, so this line stays first and the entries below keep their own owners.
* @devops-thiago @omatheusmesmo @matheusandre1

# Protect CI/CD workflows — require owner review for any changes
/.github/workflows/ @devops-thiago @omatheusmesmo @matheusandre1
/.github/CODEOWNERS @devops-thiago @omatheusmesmo @matheusandre1
# The required DCO check delegates to this validator and its regression tests.
/scripts/dco/ @devops-thiago @omatheusmesmo @matheusandre1
# Deletes container image versions; a wrong rule removes published images.
/scripts/ghcr-prune/ @devops-thiago @omatheusmesmo @matheusandre1
# The required released-history check runs this checker from the default branch.
/scripts/released-history/ @devops-thiago @omatheusmesmo @matheusandre1
